      <title>[NASA - National Aeronautics and Space Administration] The aircraft lineup just keeps getting bigger. ✈️</title>
      <link>https://www.facebook.com/reel/1557618349384047</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">fb-post-1658860588942644</guid>
      <pubDate>Fri, 16 Oct 2026 19:37:44 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;div&gt;The aircraft lineup just keeps getting bigger. ✈️&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;MAX POWER, a new aerospace expo, is set for Nov. 7-8 at NASA&amp;#x27;s Kennedy Space Center in Florida. &lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;The event features flyovers and static displays, including NASA&amp;#x27;s F-15, F-18, T-38, and ER-2 aircraft.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Learn how to secure your spot on the flightline: https://www.nasa.gov/maxpower/&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://scontent.fsgn2-9.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t15.5256-10/851783682_2036838927139255_8923795722204359961_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_tt6&amp;amp;cstp=mx405x720&amp;amp;ctp=p296x100&amp;amp;_nc_cat=104&amp;amp;_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&amp;amp;ccb=1-7&amp;amp;_nc_sid=d2b52d&amp;amp;_nc_ohc=eCo2Ar6y6z0Q7kNvwFfCDrr&amp;amp;_nc_oc=Adow8RFtzQYe8agh8A7xunYJuWnCyOWOWQvcIhGBDSWo7vcRlvoXPLavFEDpBNCx1K_vYCKBUokYRz9-KI8hgjG-&amp;amp;_nc_zt=23&amp;amp;_nc_ht=scontent.fsgn2-9.fna&amp;amp;_nc_gid=3R5eBClUALM2D0MsL7ChRA&amp;amp;_nc_ss=7b289&amp;amp;oh=00_AQO0DdBVc9byI2L1vBaHpSpx3naFhNt8u-_0EaEe0y8vpQ&amp;amp;oe=6ADD3C87" alt="Post media" style="max-width:100%;"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://scontent.fsgn2-9.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t15.5256-10/851783682_2036838927139255_8923795722204359961_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_tt6&amp;amp;cstp=mx405x720&amp;amp;ctp=s405x720&amp;amp;_nc_cat=104&amp;amp;_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&amp;amp;ccb=1-7&amp;amp;_nc_sid=be8305&amp;amp;_nc_ohc=eCo2Ar6y6z0Q7kNvwFfCDrr&amp;amp;_nc_oc=Adow8RFtzQYe8agh8A7xunYJuWnCyOWOWQvcIhGBDSWo7vcRlvoXPLavFEDpBNCx1K_vYCKBUokYRz9-KI8hgjG-&amp;amp;_nc_zt=23&amp;amp;_nc_ht=scontent.fsgn2-9.fna&amp;amp;_nc_gid=3R5eBClUALM2D0MsL7ChRA&amp;amp;_nc_ss=7b289&amp;amp;oh=00_AQO0DdBVc9byI2L1vBaHpSpx3naFhNt8u-_0EaEe0y8vpQ&amp;amp;oe=6ADD3C87" alt="Post media" style="max-width:100%;"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
